msgstr "Babilim lubab ja kontrollib seda saiti… (viimane katse: %s)"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2601
msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Kontrolli uuesti"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2614
